    "question": "Nel circuito mostrato in figura, due sorgenti ideali $V_1 = 12\\text{ V}$ e $V_2 = 18\\text{ V}$ alimentano un carico $R_L = 6\\,\\Omega$ attraverso due diodi ideali $D_1$ e $D_2$. Si calcoli la tensione d'uscita $V_{out}$ in Volt.",
    "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 260\" width=\"100%\" height=\"260\" class=\"circuit-diagram\">\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arr-blue\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 10 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#0284c7\" />\n    </marker>\n    <marker id=\"arr-red\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 10 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#dc2626\" />\n    </marker>\n    <marker id=\"arr-dark\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n      <path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 10 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n    </marker>\n</defs>\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" rx=\"8\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"14\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#64748b\" text-transform=\"uppercase\" letter-spacing=\"0.05em\">Es. NL-10: Selezione del Massimo a Diodi (Porta OR)</text>\n  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"90\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"86\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"102\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−</text>\n  <text x=\"34\" y=\"94\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"end\">V1 12 V</text>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"72\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"218.0\" y2=\"40.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"242.0\" y1=\"40.0\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <polyline points=\"220.0,50.0 238.0,40.0 220.0,30.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n  <line x1=\"238.0\" y1=\"51.0\" x2=\"238.0\" y2=\"29.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n  <text x=\"230.0\" y=\"62.0\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D1</text>\n  <circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"160\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"156\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"middle\">+</text>\n  <text x=\"60\" y=\"172\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−</text>\n  <text x=\"34\" y=\"164\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"end\">V2 18 V</text>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"178\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"218.0\" y2=\"120.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"242.0\" y1=\"120.0\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <polyline points=\"220.0,130.0 238.0,120.0 220.0,110.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n  <line x1=\"238.0\" y1=\"131.0\" x2=\"238.0\" y2=\"109.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n  <text x=\"230.0\" y=\"142.0\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D2</text>\n  <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <polyline points=\"360,80 360.0,120.0 353.0,126.66666666666666 367.0,133.33333333333334 353.0,140.0 367.0,146.66666666666669 353.0,153.33333333333334 360.0,160.0 360,200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" />\n  <text x=\"376.0\" y=\"144.0\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RL 6 Ω</text>\n  <line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"210\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"208\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"198\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"222\" y2=\"208\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"202\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"212\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" />\n  <line x1=\"206\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"214\" y2=\"216\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n  <circle cx=\"360\" cy=\"80\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n  <text x=\"372\" y=\"85\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\">Vout</text>\n  <circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"80\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" />\n</svg>",
    "correct_value": 18.0,
    "unit": "V",
    "tolerance": 0.02,
    "placeholder": "Es: 18.0",
    "hint": "Quale diodo tende a portare i catodi comuni al potenziale più alto? Il diodo con la tensione più alta si accende e spegne l'altro.",
    "solution": "**Passo 1: Ipotesi operativa**\\nPoiché $V_2 = 18\\text{ V} > V_1 = 12\\text{ V}$, il diodo $D_2$ tende a imporre un potenziale superiore sul catodo comune:\\n- Ipotizziamo $D_2$ ON e $D_1$ OFF.\\n\\n**Passo 2: Calcolo delle grandezze**\\nCon $D_2$ ON ($v_{D2} = 0$):\\n$$V_{out} = V_2 = 18.0\\text{ V}$$\\nCorrente nel carico:\\n$$i_L = \\frac{V_{out}}{R_L} = \\frac{18\\text{ V}}{6\\,\\Omega} = 3.0\\text{ A}$$\\nTale corrente attraversa $D_2$: $i_{D2} = 3.0\\text{ A} > 0$ (consistente per $D_2$).\\n\\n**Passo 3: Verifica per $D_1$**\\nL'anodo di $D_1$ è a $V_1 = 12\\text{ V}$, il catodo a $V_{out} = 18\\text{ V}$:\\n$$v_{D1} = V_1 - V_{out} = 12\\text{ V} - 18\\text{ V} = -6.0\\text{ V} \\le 0 \\quad (\\text{CONSISTENTE!})$$\\n\\nDunque $V_{out} = 18.0\\text{ V}$.",
    "exam_pitfall": "Questo è il selettore del massimo (diodes OR): l'uscita insegue sempre la sorgente con potenziale più elevato, mentre tutte le sorgenti inferiori vengono automaticamente disconnesse dai rispettivi diodi interdetti."
