"2\" fill=\"none\" />\n  <text x=\"300.0\" y=\"92.0\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L 25 mH</text>\n  <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"391.0\" y2=\"70.0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"399.0\" y1=\"70.0\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"391.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"391.0\" y2=\"54.0\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n  <line x1=\"399.0\" y1=\"86.0\" x2=\"399.0\" y2=\"54.0\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" />\n  <text x=\"395.0\" y=\"92.0\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">C 10 μF</text>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"115\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <path d=\"M 61 115 Q 65.5 108 70 115 Q 74.5 122 79 115\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" />\n  <text x=\"44\" y=\"119\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#0f172a\" text-anchor=\"end\">e(t) sinusoidale</text>\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"97\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"133\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"440\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n</svg>",
    "correct_value": 2000.0,
    "unit": "rad/s",
    "tolerance": 0.02,
    "placeholder": "Es: 2000",
    "hint": "La condizione di risonanza serie si verifica quando la parte reattiva dell'impedenza totale si annulla: $\\omega_0 L - \\frac{1}{\\omega_0 C} = 0 \\implies \\omega_0 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{LC}}$.",
    "solution": "**Passo 1: Condizione analitica di risonanza**\\n$$\\omega_0 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{LC}}$$\\n\\n**Passo 2: Calcolo numerico**\\n$$L \\cdot C = 0.025 \\cdot 10^{-5} = 2.5 \\cdot 10^{-7} = 25 \\cdot 10^{-8}\\text{ s}^2$$\\n$$\\omega_0 = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25 \\cdot 10^{-8}}} = \\frac{1}{5 \\cdot 10^{-4}} = 2000\\text{ rad/s}$$",
